1
00:00:23,744 --> 00:00:28,483
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:32,195
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:34,664
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:37,718
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:43,125
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:46,757
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:50,723
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:55,363
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,363 --> 00:01:00,003
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,391 --> 00:01:02,051
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,051 --> 00:01:08,003
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,195 --> 00:01:11,883
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,883 --> 00:01:15,454
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,619 --> 00:01:22,563
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,011 --> 00:01:26,632
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,632 --> 00:01:30,316
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:35,331
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,331 --> 00:01:39,491
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,787
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,456 --> 00:01:49,987
=Episode 10=

21
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,680
Yeah, the death is suspicious.

22
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:07,640
This woman disobeyed
her father's orders,

23
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:10,240
escaped from wedding first,
and then even murdered her father.

24
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,392
We must eliminate her.

25
00:02:11,392 --> 00:02:14,080
We've reported it to the authorities.
Maybe we should wait for them.

26
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,560
Everyone,

27
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,479
she killed her father today,

28
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:21,120
and she could kill us all tomorrow.

29
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:25,240
The Jiang family is rich.
They must have bribed the officials.

30
00:02:25,439 --> 00:02:27,439
We must kill her
before the officials arrive.

31
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,024
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

32
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,639
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

33
00:02:30,784 --> 00:02:31,680
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

34
00:02:31,936 --> 00:02:32,960
- Kill her!
- Kill her!

35
00:02:41,792 --> 00:02:46,120
How dare you
abuse private punishment in Fengcheng!

36
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:47,392
These officials

37
00:02:47,392 --> 00:02:50,368
ignore public outrage
and bend the law to protect criminals.

38
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:53,088
Even dismembering this woman
would be too lenient.

39
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:54,080
Insolent!

40
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,280
She is my wife.

41
00:02:59,968 --> 00:03:01,216
With me here,

42
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:04,879
even if the sky falls,
no one can lay a finger on her.

43
00:03:17,088 --> 00:03:20,400
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

44
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,199
Let's go.

45
00:03:24,448 --> 00:03:31,392
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

46
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:35,461
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

47
00:03:35,461 --> 00:03:39,145
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

48
00:03:39,232 --> 00:03:44,160
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

49
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:48,320
♪How can I bear to let go♪

50
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,080
Don't worry.

51
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,479
With me here, no one dares to harm you.

52
00:04:16,928 --> 00:04:18,040
It wasn't me.

53
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,120
It wasn't me.

54
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,399
I believe you.

55
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,920
How could I possibly kill my father?

56
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,399
He is my father.

57
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,360
It wasn't me.

58
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:41,879
Don't worry.

59
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:49,240
I will investigate thoroughly,
and find out the truth.

60
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:54,879
Governor,

61
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,759
Du Xiaolin of Xiaosheng Society

62
00:04:57,160 --> 00:05:00,560
took over the position of president
of Chamber of Commerce from Mr. Jiang,

63
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:03,392
and ordered his men
to intercept the grain supply

64
00:05:03,392 --> 00:05:05,289
for Fengcheng and the army
at the train station.

65
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:09,240
He is demanding you
to hand over the murderer.

66
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,360
Send someone to protect Miss Jiang.

67
00:05:22,199 --> 00:05:24,000
I will lead troops to the train station.

68
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,184
Yes!

69
00:05:32,992 --> 00:05:34,848
(Fengcheng Station)

70
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:57,560
(Whether going or coming,)

71
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,480
(all are but dreamers.)

72
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,000
Extra!

73
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:21,240
Shocking parricide case in Fengcheng!

74
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:24,959
President Jiang of Fengcheng
Chamber of Commerce died at home.

75
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:27,319
The murderer is his own daughter.

76
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,240
Extra!

77
00:06:30,399 --> 00:06:31,279
One newspaper, please.

78
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,480
Okay. Here you go.

79
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:35,360
Extra!

80
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,560
Extra!

81
00:06:37,812 --> 00:06:40,160
(President Jiang of Fengcheng
Chamber of Commerce died at home.)

82
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,344
(The murderer is his own daughter.)

83
00:06:48,224 --> 00:06:51,712
(Fengcheng Station)

84
00:06:57,536 --> 00:07:01,759
How dare a bunch of thugs
stir up trouble here!

85
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,959
You are seeking your own doom.

86
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,720
You bent the law for personal gain.

87
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:10,279
President Du
is merely upholding justice.

88
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:11,040
How dare you!

89
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:17,920
You people from Governor Mansion
are all ruthless executioners.

90
00:07:18,439 --> 00:07:20,360
There are so many civilians
on the train.

91
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:24,800
Aren't you afraid that stray bullets
will harm the innocent?

92
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,800
Kill him!

93
00:07:55,488 --> 00:07:56,000
(The murderer of President Jiang
is his own daughter.)

94
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,160
Impossible.

95
00:07:58,439 --> 00:08:01,199
Miss Jiang would never kill anyone.

96
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:20,000
Get him!

97
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,039
Go!

98
00:08:49,184 --> 00:08:49,984
- Yes!
- Yes!

99
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,960
I let you leave.

100
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:14,919
I didn't expect you to be so useless,
unable to even escape from Fengcheng.

101
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:19,240
It seems our fate is deeply intertwined.

102
00:09:29,362 --> 00:09:30,464
(Daughter of President Jiang
murdered her father)

103
00:09:32,456 --> 00:09:34,480
(Daughter of President Jiang
murdered her father)

104
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,879
Go shut down the newspaper offices
that are spreading rumors.

105
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,559
Yes!

106
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,120
Patricide is a heinous crime,

107
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,720
and punishable by death.

108
00:09:47,279 --> 00:09:50,200
Will Miss Jiang be executed?

109
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:53,159
With me here, who would dare harm her?

110
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,200
But what about her?

111
00:09:56,159 --> 00:10:00,159
Governor Xu, have you considered
what kind of situation she is in now?

112
00:10:01,759 --> 00:10:03,000
She lost her mother at a young age,

113
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:07,080
and now her father, who she depended on,
has also passed away.

114
00:10:08,399 --> 00:10:10,519
She is now deemed guilty of patricide.

115
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:15,168
Rumors are like weapons,
killing one invisibly.

116
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:20,159
With just a gun, can you keep the mouths
of all the people shut in Fengcheng?

117
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:30,000
If she has to live with the accusation,
what will she become?

118
00:10:30,624 --> 00:10:33,711
♪A fleeting life♪

119
00:10:34,336 --> 00:10:37,159
♪Suddenly it's dusk♪

120
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:37,960
Xu You'an,

121
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:42,200
Miss Jiang's wrongful accusation
is partly my fault.

122
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:45,440
I must clear her name.

123
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:50,760
♪The moon as before♪

124
00:10:51,357 --> 00:10:54,879
♪A jug of wine in the night rain♪

125
00:10:55,198 --> 00:10:58,829
♪Softly whispers♪

126
00:10:58,912 --> 00:11:00,466
♪No return♪

127
00:11:00,736 --> 00:11:02,322
♪No regret♪

128
00:11:02,592 --> 00:11:06,248
♪Wast even the best times♪

129
00:11:08,074 --> 00:11:13,120
♪Trapped in dawn and dusk♪

130
00:11:13,548 --> 00:11:15,359
♪Candle by the west window♪

131
00:11:15,488 --> 00:11:17,792
♪Burned out this life♪

132
00:11:18,088 --> 00:11:20,850
♪Ending in nothingness♪

133
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,120
Rong Xiaonan,

134
00:11:22,759 --> 00:11:24,159
do you like Chun'er?

135
00:11:25,879 --> 00:11:28,000
Do you know
what it means to like someone?

136
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,399
Of course, I do.

137
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:34,919
For her, you risked your life

138
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,559
to come to me regardless of the charge
of assassinating Governor.

139
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,639
If you don't like her, then why?

140
00:11:43,136 --> 00:11:44,860
♪Candle by the west window♪

141
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:48,120
I regard Miss Jiang just as a friend.

142
00:11:49,639 --> 00:11:53,759
I dare to come to you
because I know you won't kill me.

143
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:59,240
Otherwise, I'd have died long ago.

144
00:11:59,808 --> 00:12:02,389
♪The world's last gamble♪

145
00:12:02,662 --> 00:12:05,962
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

146
00:12:07,224 --> 00:12:13,792
♪No one comes to meet me♪

147
00:12:41,216 --> 00:12:42,496
♪As if it were fate♪

148
00:12:42,496 --> 00:12:43,853
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

149
00:12:44,415 --> 00:12:47,652
♪We miss each other♪

150
00:12:48,896 --> 00:12:50,464
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

151
00:12:50,464 --> 00:12:52,864
♪And a bizarre♪

152
00:12:52,864 --> 00:12:55,666
♪Anonymous legend♪

153
00:12:56,196 --> 00:12:58,208
♪The plot twists and turns♪

154
00:12:58,356 --> 00:13:00,096
♪Play out over and over again♪

155
00:13:00,096 --> 00:13:03,160
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

156
00:13:03,456 --> 00:13:05,440
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

157
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,432
♪Refuse to submit♪

158
00:13:06,432 --> 00:13:09,632
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

159
00:13:11,296 --> 00:13:14,208
♪There are always too many♪

160
00:13:14,208 --> 00:13:16,096
♪Helpless situations♪

161
00:13:16,096 --> 00:13:18,720
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

162
00:13:19,851 --> 00:13:21,811
♪Even if I have questions♪

163
00:13:21,811 --> 00:13:23,811
♪I harbor desires♪

164
00:13:23,811 --> 00:13:26,688
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

165
00:13:27,039 --> 00:13:28,672
♪People come and go♪

166
00:13:28,672 --> 00:13:31,488
♪I'm still all alone♪

167
00:13:31,488 --> 00:13:34,216
♪Wandering around♪

168
00:13:34,464 --> 00:13:37,317
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

169
00:13:37,317 --> 00:13:41,778
♪Go through the entanglement♪

170
00:13:42,144 --> 00:13:43,936
♪If longing♪

171
00:13:43,936 --> 00:13:47,031
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

172
00:13:47,031 --> 00:13:49,786
♪How can I be at ease♪

173
00:13:49,888 --> 00:13:52,202
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

174
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,176
♪And travelled around the world♪

175
00:13:54,272 --> 00:13:57,360
♪Scars all over me♪

176
00:13:57,632 --> 00:14:00,640
♪If longing never fades♪

177
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,993
♪Burns still hot♪

178
00:14:01,993 --> 00:14:05,072
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

179
00:14:05,344 --> 00:14:07,201
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

180
00:14:07,264 --> 00:14:08,448
♪In the next life♪

181
00:14:08,448 --> 00:14:12,928
♪Entangle with you again♪
